+## 13. Source-memory locking, cancellation, and resonant tracking
+
+Define
+
+\[
+E_n=\Delta z_n-\Delta C_n,
+\qquad
+S_n=\Delta z_{n+1}-\Delta z_n.
+\]
+
+The exact tracking recurrence is
+
+\[
+E_{n+1}=\alpha E_n+S_n.
+\]
+
+Late replay data support
